  "name": "First Partner Illustration Collection—Series 3",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A collection launched on 7 August 2026 with nine illustration rare–style promos of the first partners of Hoenn, Kalos and Paldea. Each collection held a pack of three of the nine, with two more booster packs and a sticker sheet. Side by side, each region's three cards make one long picture: Treecko, Torchic and Mudkip of Hoenn, Chespin, Fennekin and Froakie of Kalos, Sprigatito, Fuecoco and Quaxly of Paldea.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon: Pokémon TCG: First Partner Illustration Collection—Series 3",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.com/us/pokemon-tcg/product-gallery/first-partner-illustration-collection-series-3"
      }
    ]
  },
